    "title": "A Serene Mountain Lake in the Middle Atlas",
    "p1": "Dayet Aoua is one of the most famous and scenic natural lakes in the Middle Atlas region, located a short and pleasant drive from Ifrane. Surrounded by rolling hills, oak groves, and cedar forests, it offers a peaceful retreat for nature lovers and outdoor enthusiasts.",
